name textfit
category Package
revision 20591
shortdesc Fit text to a desired size
relocated 1
longdesc Package to fit text to a given width or height by scaling the
longdesc font. For example: \scaletowidth{3in}{This}. (The job is done
longdesc by calculating a magstep and applying it to the current font;
longdesc thus "This" will be very tall, as well as very wide; to scale
longdesc in just one dimension, use the facilities of the graphicx
longdesc package.)
runfiles size=2
